mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions + connections\n\ncollabs-and-cross-promotion is a **strategy/relationship skill** — it picks the partner, plans the\ncross-promo, and writes both sides. The agent **advises + drafts + plans**; **WoopSocial publishes each\npartner's own posts** on the coordinated schedule; the **co-created content + the relationship are\nnative/human.**\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The agent** picks a complementary, same-size, values-aligned partner; chooses the format; **drafts the\n  outreach**; plans the **cross-promo** (timing/CTA/what-to-say/who-does-what); and **writes each partner's\n  posts.**\n- **WoopSocial publishes each partner's OWN posts to their OWN accounts** on the agreed schedule, with the\n  **mention in the caption.** It does **NOT**: create a **native IG Collab co-authored post** (native-only —\n  not in the spec's Instagram fields), **run giveaway mechanics**, **duet/stitch** (native / via the video\n  file), **DM to find or pitch partners** (no DM surface), or **manage the agreement.**\n- **The co-created/co-authored content** (joint video, live, duet, IG Collab, YouTube's native Collaboration\n  invite) and the **relationship** are **native/human.**\n- **Disclosure:** a **pure mutual collab (no payment) is NOT a sponsorship** — no #ad. **If money/free\n  product changes hands → it's a sponsorship → disclose** → route to `ugc-and-influencer`/\n  `creator-monetization`. **Partnerships must be genuine** — no bought/faked engagement (fraud; detectable;\n  hurts both). **Never fabricate metrics** — per-source native analytics only. **Verify-quarterly.**\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **collabs-and-cross-promotion (this)** — **creator-to-creator MUTUAL** partnership (unpaid; both\n  contribute + both promote).\n- **ugc-and-influencer** — **brand→creator** (the brand buys an asset/reach; **paid/licensed + disclosed**).\n- **creator-monetization** — the **creator's own income** streams (membership/products/sponsorships).\n- **social-selling-and-dm** — the **DM outreach mechanics** (could be used to pitch a partner; this skill\n  decides who/why, that one runs the conversation).\n- **campaign-and-launch-planning** — the **campaign wrapper** a collab may sit inside.\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** `brand-profile` (niche/audience/values), `goals-and-kpis` (the growth goal + success\n  metric).\n- **Pairs with:** `caption-writer`/`hook-writer` (each side's posts), the **format skills**\n  (`youtube-publishing-and-metadata`, `tiktok-video-publishing`, `carousel-writer`, …) for the actual posts,\n  `social-selling-and-dm` (the outreach conversation), `lead-magnets-and-funnels`/`email-and-newsletter`\n  (newsletter swaps).\n- **Publishes via:** `scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial` (each partner's own posts, coordinated) +\n  `platform-specs-and-validation` (validate each post). `content-calendar` slots the ~1–2/month cadence.\n- **Measures with:** `analytics-and-reporting` (per-source CTR/subs/retention). **Co-created content + the\n  relationship + any required disclosure stay native/human.**\n"
